===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[less]]
#: ''Faites '''moins''' de bruit.'' — “Make less noise.”
# {{context|with numbers}} [[minus]]; [[negative]]
#: '''''moins''' cinq'' — “minus five”
# {{context|preceded by a [[definite article]]}} the [[least]]
#: ''Il gagne le '''moins''' d'argent dans sa famille.'' — “He earns the least money in his family.”
#: ''C'était la chose la '''moins''' surprenante.'' — “It was the least surprising thing.”

